{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1335","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Construct the String"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given three positive integers $$$n$$$, $$$a$$$ and $$$b$$$. You have to construct a string $$$s$$$ of length $$$n$$$ consisting of lowercase Latin letters such that "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"each substring"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of length $$$a$$$ has "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$b$$$ distinct letters. It is guaranteed that the answer exists."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have to answer $$$t$$$ independent test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Recall that the substring $$$s[l \\dots r]$$$ is the string $$$s_l, s_{l+1}, \\dots, s_{r}$$$ and its length is $$$r - l + 1$$$. In this problem you are only interested in substrings of length $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains one integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 2000$$$) — the number of test cases. Then $$$t$$$ test cases follow."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The only line of a test case contains three space-separated integers $$$n$$$, $$$a$$$ and $$$b$$$ ($$$1 